## Part 13 — What the Next Jules Project Should NOT Do

**Do not:**
- Add more feature layers (Carter field ops, additional views, additional formulas) until Phases A–H are complete.
- Build a backend until the frontend is honest.
- Add more tests without first making the existing tests run.
- Refactor for style before fixing the bugs.
